  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "新版文娱论开录  (Rolling Cameras on the Revamped Talk Show)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over in Studio Four, Unit Two's producer Lin Jie prepares to tape the revamped Entertainment Talk with an international comedy guest, greeting host Wen Simo just before cameras roll. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "所有的音频，该调好的调好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "杏子姐今天不在，让我来负责艺人的工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这次能请到米娜，多亏了杏子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这杏子不在，我心里还真挺没底的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "米娜的工作餐，你都照顾得特别合他胃口，他特别满意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这都是我们应该做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "闻老师，辛苦了！你怎么带客人来这儿了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你这人真闲得慌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "没什么问题，咱们差不多开始了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "坐远点，一会儿别出声啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现场各就各位，闻老师，可以了，开始！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "所有的音频，该调好的调好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Make sure every audio channel that needs tuning is properly set.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "杏子姐今天不在，让我来负责艺人的工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi is out today and put me in charge of guest hospitality.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这次能请到米娜，多亏了杏子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Booking Mina this time was all thanks to Xingzi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这杏子不在，我心里还真挺没底的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without Xingzi on set, I honestly feel a little uncertain.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "米娜的工作餐，你都照顾得特别合他胃口，他特别满意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You arranged Mina's crew meal right to his taste, and he is delighted.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这都是我们应该做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is all part of doing our job properly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "闻老师，辛苦了！你怎么带客人来这儿了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen Simo, thank you for your hard work! What brings your guest here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你这人真闲得慌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really have too much free time on your hands.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "没什么问题，咱们差不多开始了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem at all—we are just about ready to begin.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "坐远点，一会儿别出声啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sit further back and do not make a sound in a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现场各就各位，闻老师，可以了，开始！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone take your positions on set—Mr Wen Simo, we are ready, action!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "所有的音频，该调好的调好。",
      "gap": 0.5
